      "id": "blk_786b0ec6",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "坐落于郊外悬崖边，幽暗神秘的古老城堡。﻿",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 2,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 3,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_e2470c61",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "﻿周遭遍布着深海生物般的植被，内部汇聚着古怪的珍稀收藏，极尽诱人，极尽怪诞，犹如深不见底的漩涡，邀请着对它心生倾慕的人迈入。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 3,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 4,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_3d412fbe",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "波蒂维诺堡是翡萨烈家族的宅邸，坐落于狄萨莱海脊的悬崖边，神秘而华丽。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 4,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 5,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_f67cf9c2",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "翡萨烈的产业遍布整个黎那汐塔，而这座散发着“生人勿进”气息的悬崖古堡无疑是最特别的——现任翡萨烈家主长居于此。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
